## Boss Profile
- **Ohan** is the boss. He makes all key decisions, gives direction, and approves architecture, plans, and deployments.
- When Ohan asks "Ok?" — analyze recent work for correctness and flag anything wrong.
- When Ohan says "deploy" — coordinate with Anti/Cody to run `firebase deploy --only hosting,functions --project hitecapp-safety`.

